{"2679830": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Crowned In Steel", "steam_appid": 2679830, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Crowned in Steel</strong> is a skill-based action adventure and our attempt at making combat that feels responsive, weighty and viciously satisfying once mastered.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2679830/extras/eb0c5706ca337a94a457e51d9d34db1b.poster.avif?t=1783097002\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2679830/extras/eb0c5706ca337a94a457e51d9d34db1b.webm?t=1783097002\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2679830/extras/eb0c5706ca337a94a457e51d9d34db1b.mp4?t=1783097002\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combat is based on chaining different strikes. Alternate between four directions to keep your chain fast, turn parries and dodges into counterattacks, and string the right sequences into combos that deal massive damage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mashing buttons gets you killed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2679830/extras/9ac059c47afc225da91455cd609ed985.poster.avif?t=1783097002\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2679830/extras/9ac059c47afc225da91455cd609ed985.webm?t=1783097002\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2679830/extras/9ac059c47afc225da91455cd609ed985.mp4?t=1783097002\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enemies respond to all of your actions. They will block, dodge, feint, taunt and counter your attacks. You must adapt to their moves and react accordingly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Meaty combat.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Full dismemberment.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Handcrafted levels.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Peak male fantasy.</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2679830/extras/fc72d6bc66dd83e1160459565b37aa09.poster.avif?t=1783097002\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2679830/extras/fc72d6bc66dd83e1160459565b37aa09.webm?t=1783097002\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2679830/extras/fc72d6bc66dd83e1160459565b37aa09.mp4?t=1783097002\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Go forth and conquer.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Crowned in Steel</strong> is a skill-based action adventure and our attempt at making combat that feels responsive, weighty and viciously satisfying once mastered.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2679830/extras/eb0c5706ca337a94a457e51d9d34db1b.poster.avif?t=1783097002\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2679830/extras/eb0c5706ca337a94a457e51d9d34db1b.webm?t=1783097002\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2679830/extras/eb0c5706ca337a94a457e51d9d34db1b.mp4?t=1783097002\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combat is based on chaining different strikes. Alternate between four directions to keep your chain fast, turn parries and dodges into counterattacks, and string the right sequences into combos that deal massive damage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mashing buttons gets you killed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2679830/extras/9ac059c47afc225da91455cd609ed985.poster.avif?t=1783097002\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2679830/extras/9ac059c47afc225da91455cd609ed985.webm?t=1783097002\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2679830/extras/9ac059c47afc225da91455cd609ed985.mp4?t=1783097002\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enemies respond to all of your actions. They will block, dodge, feint, taunt and counter your attacks. You must adapt to their moves and react accordingly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Meaty combat.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Full dismemberment.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Handcrafted levels.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Peak male fantasy.</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2679830/extras/fc72d6bc66dd83e1160459565b37aa09.poster.avif?t=1783097002\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2679830/extras/fc72d6bc66dd83e1160459565b37aa09.webm?t=1783097002\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2679830/extras/fc72d6bc66dd83e1160459565b37aa09.mp4?t=1783097002\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Go forth and conquer.</p>", "short_description": "Crush, stab, slice, rend, break, maim and decapitate your enemies in a skill-based action-adventure with brutal combat and full dismemberment.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2679830/2619bfb6a7fe67e6b50b5499a6cc550bb2b20e0c/header.jpg?t=1783097002", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2679830/4967168e0a9275f54b3cc4c439396811a55bb876/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1783097002", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2679830/4967168e0a9275f54b3cc4c439396811a55bb876/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1783097002", "website": "https://sverun.com/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> intel i5 8400 | AMD Ryzen 5 1600<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> 4GBs VRAM | NVIDIA GTX-1050ti | AMD Radeon RX 580<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 3 GB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> W